    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0538" n="534" sameAs="frus:frus1939v03/pg534"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.946/425: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Peck</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-05-02T12:00:00+07:00">May 2,
                            1939—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received May 2—7:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>303. The local press has given prominence to reported resolution introduced by
                    Senator Pittman which would authorize the President to restrict trade with
                    countries violating the Nine Power Treaty. The British Ambassador informed me
                    May 1 that the Minister for Foreign Affairs,<anchor n="6" xml:id="d512-f1"/>
                    acting apparently on the assumption that this or a similar measure will be
                    enacted by Congress, has urged him try to introduce the British Government to
                    initiate some step by the League of Nations to bring about similar action by
                    League members. Foreign Office officials as also the British Ambassador have
                    asked me whether there is any probability that the resolution in question will
                    be adopted and I have pointed out the impossibility of making any
                    prediction.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Peiping.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peck</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d512-f1" n="6" xml:id="d512-f1-content">
